# Anonymous analytics (#450): PostHog EU, cookieless. Optional: without it the
# game sends nothing. Only a public project token (phc_…) is accepted; the host
# is fixed to PostHog's EU cloud. Off in `npm run dev` unless VITE_POSTHOG_DEV=1.
VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=
# VITE_POSTHOG_DEV=1

# Developer settings in Settings. On in every build until launch (GitHub Pages,
# the Android test APK, local dev). Set to 0 to hide it again; then only
# ?labs=1 or a playtest career shows it. false, off and no also hide it.
# VITE_DEV_SETTINGS=0
